 study of a chest pain observation unit in a British hospital</article-title><source>Emerg Med J</source><year>2002</year><volume>19</volume><fpage>117</fpage><lpage>121</lpage><pub-id pub-id-type="doi">10.1136/emj.19.2.117</pub-id><pub-id pub-id-type="pmid">11904256</pub-id></mixed-citation></ref><ref id="CR25"><label>25.</label><mixed-citation publication-type="journal"><person-group person-group-type="author"><name><surname>Tatum</surname><given-names>JL</given-names></name><name><surname>Jesse</surname><given-names>RL</given-names></name><name><surname>Kontos</surname><given-names>MC</given-names></name><name><surname>Nicholson</surname><given-names>CS</given-names></name><name><surname>Schmidt</surname><given-names>KL</given-names></name><name><surname>Roberts</surname><given-names>CS</given-names></name><name><surname>Ornato</surname><given-names>JP</given-names></name></person-group><article-title>Comprehensive strategy for the evaluation and triage of the chest pain patient</article-title><source>Ann Emerg Med</source><year>1997</year><volume>29</volume><fpage>116</fpage><lpage>125</lpage><pub-id pub-id-type="doi">10.1016/S0196-0644(97)70317-2</pub-id><pub-id pub-id-type="pmid">8998090</pub-id></mixed-citation></ref><ref id="CR26"><label>26.</label><mixed-citation publication-type="journal"><person-group person-group-type="author"><name><surname>Gibler</surname><given-names>WB</given-names></name><name><surname>Runyon</surname><given-names>JP</given-names></name><name><surname>Levy</surname><given-names>RC</given-names></name><name><surname>Sayre</surname><given-names>MR</given-names></name><name><surname>Kacich</surname><given-names>R</given-names></name><name><surname>Hattemer</surname><given-names>CR</given-names></name><name><surname>Hamilton</surname><given-names>C</given-names></name><name><surname>Gerlach</surname><given-names>JW</given-names></name><name><surname>Walsh</surname><given-names>RA</given-names></name></person-group><article-title>A rapid diagnostic and treatment center for patients with chest pain in the emergency department</article-title><source>Ann Emerg Med</source><year>1995</year><volume>25</volume><fpage>1</fpage><lpage>8</lpage><pub-id pub-id-type="doi">10.1016/S0196-0644(95)70347-0</pub-id><pub-id pub-id-type="pmid">7802357</pub-id></mixed-citation></ref></ref-list><fn-group><fn><p>The views expressed in this paper are those of the author(s) and not those of the editors, editorial board or publisher.</p></fn></fn-group></back></article>